Motorola 68030 machine-dependent kernel code (see docs/porting/, decision D13).

Layout:

    files.kconf, devices.kconf, Makefile.kconf
                    - read by kconfig from "../" relative to a board directory
                      (added in M1; Config.generic is planned, see D13)
    newvers.sh      - writes vers.c with the version banner at link time
    *.c, *.h, *.S   - machine-dependent kernel code, flat; board-specific
                      drivers use a prefix (gf_*.c Goldfish, virtio_*.c)
    virt/           - QEMU "virt" board: Config, generated Makefile, kernel.ld

Files are added as the backlog milestones reach them.
